      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dysart%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town is named after Joseph Dysart, a local farmer who helped establish the community.",
